    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) both: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115...";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The fact that the evidence was obtained as a result of a person engaging in criminal activity is to be disregarded if... (i) the person was a participant in an operation authorized under a corresponding State controlled operations law acting in the course of that operation; and (ii) the criminal activity was conduct constituting an offence for which a person would, but for section 15HH, be criminally responsible.";
