    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) The chief officer of a law enforcement agency (the originating agency) may agree in writing with the chief officer of another law enforcement agency (the receiving agency) to transfer control of an authority...";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "...if:  (a) the authority was granted by the chief officer of the originating agency; or  (b) control of the authority was transferred to the chief officer of the originating agency under a previous application of this subsection.";
