    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Overlaps";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Defines the temporal overlap between the crime and the order.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(11) A person commits an offence if:  (a) an order has been made under subsection (8), (9) or (10); and  (b) the person engages in conduct; and  (c) the conduct contravenes the order.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The crime overlaps with the order in time.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::interval_reasoning";
