    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Repeats";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Defines the repeating nature of the crime.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(11) A person commits an offence if:  (a) an order has been made under subsection (8), (9) or (10); and  (b) the person engages in conduct; and  (c) the conduct contravenes the order.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The crime repeats indefinitely.";
