    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This item applies to a participant in an operation authorised under a State controlled operations law if:";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The conduct must occur before or at the same time as the commencement of the operation.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::interval_reasoning";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 0.5000;
