    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) Despite any other law of the Commonwealth, the participant is not criminally responsible for the Commonwealth offence, if:";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The participant is permitted to engage in conduct that meets these conditions.";
